            "subject": "LU-12669 ec: fix EC recovery read for encrypted files"
          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Bobi Jam",
          "email": "bobijam@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-06-05 09:15:11.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Bobi Jam",
          "email": "bobijam@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-06-05 11:16:51.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-12669 ec: optimize EC recovery crypto for encrypted files",
        "message": "LU-12669 ec: optimize EC recovery crypto for encrypted files\n\nFor encrypted files with EC layout, the current implementation wastes\nsignificant CPU by:\n1. OSC decrypts pages after reading from OST\n2. LOV re-encrypts the same pages for EC recovery\n3. LOV decrypts all pages (recovered + available) after EC recovery\n\nThis patch optimizes by having OSC save the encrypted page data to\nbounce pages provided by LOV, eliminating redundant encrypt/decrypt:\n1. OSC decrypts pages AND saves original encrypted data to bounce\n   pages\n2. LOV reuses the encrypted bounce pages (no encryption needed)\n3. LOV only decrypts recovered pages (data pages already plaintext)\n\nSigned-off-by: Bobi Jam <bobijam@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Id140903622aedca408d08c895acf308b35211af9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
